87
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:13,799
But it's too late to make any improvements now. The universe is

88
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:18,357
finished. The cop stone is on, and the chips were carted off a million years

89
00:07:18,358 --> 00:07:23,558
ago. Poor Lazarus there chattering his teeth against the curbstone for his

90
00:07:23,559 --> 00:07:28,279
pillow and shaking off his tatters with his shiverings. He might plug up both

91
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:33,317
ears with rags and put a corn cob in his mouth. And yet that would not keep out

92
00:07:33,318 --> 00:07:40,357
the tempestuous uracon. Uraladon says old Dies in his red silken wrapper. He

93
00:07:40,358 --> 00:07:46,038
had a redder one afterwards. Poo poo what a fine frosty night. How Orion

94
00:07:46,039 --> 00:07:51,399
glitters. What northern lights. Let them talk of their oriental summer climbs of

95
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:56,118
everlasting conservatories. Give me the privilege of making my own summer with

96
00:07:56,119 --> 00:07:59,879
my own coals. But what thinks Lazarus?

97
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:04,439
Can he warm his blue hands by holding them up to the grand northern lights?

98
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:09,479
Would not Lazarus rather be in Sumatra than here? Would he not far rather lay

99
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:14,439
him down lengthwise along the line of the equator? Yeah, ye gods, go down to

100
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:18,598
the fiery pit itself in order to keep out this frost.

101
00:08:18,599 --> 00:08:22,678
Now that Lazarus should lie stranded there on the curbstone before the door

102
00:08:22,679 --> 00:08:27,317
of Dies, this is more wonderful than that an iceberg should be mored to one

103
00:08:27,318 --> 00:08:33,479
of the Mlokas. Yet Dies himself, he too lives like a zar in an ice palace made

104
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:39,399
of frozen size, and being president of a temperance society, he only drinks the

105
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:42,357
